---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_capital: caller authorized
    q_check_capital --> q_revert_state: capital not published
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert CapitalNotPublished
    q_check_capital --> q_check_published: capital published
    q_check_published --> q_revert_dup: results already published
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert ResultsAlreadyPublished
    q_check_published --> q_set_data: results not yet published
    q_set_data --> q_set_token: set claimMerkleRoot, totalTokensAllocated
    q_set_token --> q_set_accepted: set askToken address (from TGE)
    q_set_accepted --> [*]: set acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot, resultsPublished = true, emit SaleResultsPublished

    note right of q_set_token
        INV-001: askToken set here (post-TGE, not at initialization)
        INV-002: Merkle roots for claims and accepted capital set simultaneously
    end note

    note right of q_set_data
        INV-003: requires capital to be published first
        INV-004: results are immutable once published
    end note
